<title>ROMANIA: RUGBY UNION-FRANCE BEAT ROMANIA 51-20.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-FRANCE BEAT ROMANIA 51-20.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1997-06-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>France beat Romania   51-20</p>
<p>(halftime 29-10) in their rugby union test on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Romania - Tries: Romeo Gontineac, Margarit Radoi. Penalties: Neculai Nichitean (2). Conversions: Nichitean (2).</p>
<p>France - Tries: David Venditti (2), Philippe Bernat-Salles (2), Olivier Viars (2), Abdelatif Benazzi, Alain Penaud, Olivier Merle. Conversions: Christophe Lamaison (2), Sebastien Viars.</p>
<p>Referee: Claudio Giacomel (Italy)</p>
<p>Attendance: 10,000.</p>
